2. **Detect splits from the close series**, not PREV_CLOSE — a single-session move whose
   inverse ratio lands within 5% of a round integer ≥2. This method found all 148 events
   cleanly when tested.

**What is NOT affected:** the other ~1,100 names in the scan; all ATR, stop and drawdown work
(that was Bug 1); and every conclusion about the 4-week entry rule — only 3 of 33 simulated
entries touched an affected symbol, and the finding was stronger on the clean subset.

