**Full rationale, evidence tables and the rejected alternative are in
`reference/CHANGE_NOTE_2026-09-26.md`. Summary only here.**

**What changed.** `caps.csv` previously covered only the Nifty 500. Everything outside it reached
the sizing layer with no tier, was silently defaulted to SMALL, and was then blocked by the RISK-OFF
"large/mid only" mandate — **42% of the tradeable universe and 95% of the top 40 three-month
